  "notes": "{照|て}る is an intransitive verb meaning to shine (of the sun, etc.).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{照|て}らす→照らす：04669_terasu⟧ (transitive, to illuminate)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {照|て}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ means 'is shining' (ongoing state)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{太陽|たいよう}→太陽：03398_taiyou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{照|て}る: the sun shines\n- ⟦{日|ひ}→日：02249_hi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{照|て}る: the sun shines\n- ⟦{照|て}り{返|かえ}す→照り返す：28906_terikaesu⟧: to reflect (light)\n\nWEATHER EXPRESSION:\n{照|て}ったり⟦{降|ふ}ったり→降る：00839_furu⟧ = sometimes sunny, sometimes rainy (changeable weather)",
